        ("Nós somos estudantes.","We are students.","Somos agrees with nós."),
        ("Eles são angolanos.","They are Angolan.","Nationality adjective is masculine plural."),
        ("A minha mãe é médica.","My mother is a doctor.","Médica agrees with a feminine subject."),
        ("És tu o novo colega?","Are you the new colleague?","És is the tu form of ser."),
